# Model card for google (medium)

* Language: af_ZA (Afrikaans, South Africa)
* Speakers: 9
* Quality: medium
* Samplerate: 22,050Hz

## Dataset

* URL: https://openslr.org/32/
* License: Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International

Lines that were English rather than Afrikaans were filtered out of the training data.

## Training

Finetuned from the U.S. English hifi_tts_92 base model (medium quality; the voice of Cori Samuel, Hi-Fi TTS reader 92), with MRD and SDP.

Default inference settings are noise_scale 0.5 and noise_w 0.333.

Requires Piper 1.5 or higher.
